&lt;h2 id=&#34;license&#34;&gt;License
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This project is licensed under the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./LICENSE&#34; &gt;MIT License&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting from version 1.1.4, the open source license for the Anx Reader project has been changed from the MIT License to the GNU General Public License version 3 (GPLv3).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After version 1.2.6, the selection and highlight feature has been rewritten, and the open source license has been changed from the GPL-3.0 License to the MIT License. All contributors agree to this change(#116).&lt;/p&gt;
